<title>UK: CRICKET-CAIRNS SIGNS TWO-YEAR CONTRACT WITH NOTTINGHAMSHIRE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-CAIRNS SIGNS TWO-YEAR CONTRACT WITH NOTTINGHAMSHIRE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand all-rounder Chris Cairns has signed a further two-year contract with English county side Nottinghamshire.</p>
<p>&quot;My association with Notts goes back to 1988 and I regard Trent Bridge as my second home,&quot; Cairns said. &quot;I only hope my international commitments will not keep me away for too long.&quot;</p>
</text>
